#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:2
msgid "Full-One-Electron Fixed-MO Embedding"
msgstr "固定分子轨道完整单电子嵌入"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:4
msgid ""
"Compare H2/STO-3G resource estimates in vacuum and near one TIP3P water. The embedded estimates "
"use ``diagonal`` and ``full_oneelectron`` modes."
msgstr "比较真空与一个 TIP3P 水分子附近的 H2/STO-3G 资源估算。嵌入估算使用 ``diagonal`` 和 ``full_oneelectron`` 模式。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:8
msgid "Run The Script"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:14
msgid ""
"The script prints Hamiltonian ``lambda``, Toffoli count, logical qubits, and "
"``delta_h_offdiag_fro`` for:"
msgstr "脚本为以下各行打印哈密顿量 ``lambda``、Toffoli 门数、逻辑量子比特数及 ``delta_h_offdiag_fro``："

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:20
msgid "Row"
msgstr "结果行"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:21
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:22
msgid "``vacuum``"
msgstr "``vacuum``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:23
msgid "H2 without MM point charges"
msgstr "没有 MM 点电荷的 H2"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:24
msgid "``diagonal``"
msgstr "``diagonal``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:25
msgid "Fixed-MO point-charge perturbation with only active-space ``Delta h_pp``"
msgstr "固定分子轨道点电荷扰动，仅包含活性空间 ``Delta h_pp``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:26
msgid "``full_oneelectron``"
msgstr "``full_oneelectron``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:27
msgid "Fixed-MO point-charge perturbation with full active-space ``Delta h_pq``"
msgstr "固定分子轨道点电荷扰动，包含完整活性空间 ``Delta h_pq``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:30
msgid "Minimal API Pattern"
msgstr "最小 API 用法"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:75
msgid "Interpretation Boundaries"
msgstr "解释边界"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:77
msgid ""
"``full_oneelectron`` means the resource row includes the full fixed-MO active-space one-electron "
"perturbation. It does not mean relaxed orbital optimization, a polarizable MM force field, or a "
"relaxed solvation energy."
msgstr "``full_oneelectron`` 表示资源结果行包含完整的固定分子轨道活性空间单电子扰动。它不表示弛豫轨道优化、可极化 MM 力场或弛豫后的溶剂化能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.rst:81
msgid ""
"The current runtime coefficient workflow updates only diagonal terms. Full-one-electron embedding"
" is available for resource estimates and fixed Hamiltonian/operator paths because off-diagonal "
"one-electron terms can change the compiled operator support."
msgstr "当前运行时系数工作流仅更新对角项。完整单电子嵌入可用于资源估计及固定哈密顿量 / 算符路径，因为非对角单电子项可能改变编译的算符支撑。"
